      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at some recent AUV telemetry from a deep-sea trench deployment. Can you walk me through the relationship between temperature and salinity specifically regarding how they influence water density? I'm trying to calibrate our models for the thermohaline gradients we're seeing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
